      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/fisharchive/nannostomus-trifasciatus-2/",
      "html": "<p>The Threestripe pencilfish, Nannostomus trifasciatus, is one of the most beautiful traditional aquarium fish. Nannostomus: from ancient Greek, means \"with a tiny mouth\". trifasciatus: Latin, means \"with three stripes\".</p>"
